Feature: Generic complete-feature prompt composition
  Accepted implementation is finalized using durable evidence, delivery operations, and reusable learning.

  Scenario: All implementation and human gates are satisfied
    Given an arbitrary feature has resolved phases, findings, code review, and manual tests
    When its completion prompt is composed
    Then full configured validation and acceptance-test traceability are required
    And the feature may be finalized only with durable evidence

  Scenario: Completion succeeds across repositories
    Given an arbitrary feature touched one or more local repositories
    When completion work is performed
    Then focused commits, pushes, branch merges, MemoryBank movement, and safe worktree cleanup are reported
    And linked parent progress is reconciled from current children

  Scenario: Completion produces reusable learning
    Given deterministic human estimates and measured AI execution are available
    When the completion report is composed
    Then delivery gain leads the estimation retrospective
    And one future prediction recommendation and reusable lessons are persisted

  Scenario: A recoverable completion operation fails
    Given a check, documentation update, or git operation fails
    When the resilient error path is followed
    Then diagnosis, repair, and verification repeat before escalation
    And only a genuine unresolved blocker prevents completion
